  "_note": "CODE HIGHLIGHT corpus - the `<code>` element's token spans, one shared scanner per renderer (TS packages/kernel/src/jse/highlight.ts, Kotlin Highlight.kt, Swift Highlight.swift). This is NOT the evaluator's tokenizer: that one strips comments, runs ASI and returns values with no offsets, which is right for running code and useless for drawing it. The one rule the two MUST share is whether a `/` opens a regex or divides.",
